WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:12.967
<v><b>Neighbour:</b></v> Oh, hello Isabel. Come in! We’re having a party. It’s my birthday!

2
00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:16.612
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Oh! Er, Happy Birthday!

3
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.942
<v><b>Neighbour:</b></v> Thanks. Would you like a drink?

4
00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:24.011
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Actually, I want to talk to you about the noise.

5
00:00:24.011 --> 00:00:25.084
<v><b>Neighbour:</b></v> Sorry?

6
00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:28.691
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> The NOISE. It’s very noisy.

7
00:00:28.709 --> 00:00:30.874
<v><b>Neighbour:</b></v> Yes. We’re having a great time!

8
00:00:30.883 --> 00:00:34.018
Come in and have a drink. Glass of wine?

9
00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:38.042
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Oh, well, yes, OK.

10
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:41.020
<v><b>Neighbour:</b></v> Here you are. Come and meet my friends.

11
00:00:41.094 --> 00:00:45.506
Hey, everyone, say hello to Isabel. She lives next door!

12
00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:47.837
<v><b>All:</b></v> Hello, Isabel.

13
00:00:48.271 --> 00:00:49.002
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Hello.

14
00:00:49.326 --> 00:00:53.146
<v><b>Neighbour:</b></v> I love this song! Come and dance, Isabel…!

15
00:00:53.192 --> 00:00:55.698
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> I really can’t dance.

16
00:00:55.717 --> 00:00:56.503
<v><b>Neighbour:</b></v> Come on…

17
00:00:57.382 --> 00:00:59.666
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Oh, OK then.